{"seq":2,"slug":"error-emptyrate-regression","title":"错误率/零结果率回归","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-query-replay-diff/perf-correctness-regression/error-emptyrate-regression","wordCount":1948,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"错误率-零结果率回归\">错误率/零结果率回归</h1><p>搜索引擎最危险的回归不是变慢，而是<strong>静默地什么都不返回</strong>。一个抛异常的请求会被监控抓走，一个返回空结果的请求看起来完全正常——HTTP 200、结构合法、只是 <code>hits.total = 0</code>。这类回归可以在无人察觉的情况下持续数小时，直到业务方发现转化率掉了才被追查。回放平台因此在延迟之外必须稳定地度量两条曲线：错误率和零结果率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三个层级的-没结果\">核心概念：三个层级的「没结果」</h2><p>「没结果」在搜索链路里至少有三种互不相同的含义，混在一起统计会让报告失去方向。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[请求] --&gt; B{执行成功?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[错误: 异常/超时/降级]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D{命中数 &gt; 0?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[零结果]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F{过滤后可见?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[全部被过滤/折叠掉]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[有效结果]\">graph TD\n  A[请求] --&gt; B{执行成功?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[错误: 异常/超时/降级]\n  B --&gt;|是| D{命中数 &gt; 0?}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[零结果]\n  D --&gt;|是| F{过滤后可见?}\n  F --&gt;|否| G[全部被过滤/折叠掉]\n  F --&gt;|是| H[有效结果]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>判定</th>\n<th>典型成因</th>\n<th>用户感知</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>错误</td>\n<td>抛异常、超时、显式降级</td>\n<td>语法变化、字段缺失、资源耗尽</td>\n<td>报错页 / 无限加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零结果</td>\n<td><code>total_hits = 0</code></td>\n<td>分析器变化、过滤条件收紧、召回逻辑改动</td>\n<td>「没有找到相关商品」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全过滤</td>\n<td>过滤前有、过滤后无</td>\n<td>过滤规则、库存同步、权限判定</td>\n<td>结果数突然变成 0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者都需要与基准对比。如果基准就是零结果，候选也是零结果，这是「一致」而不是「回归」——这解释了为什么零结果率必须在<strong>同一批查询上做条件对比</strong>，而不能只看绝对水平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"错误率回归-分类比总量更有用\">错误率回归：分类比总量更有用</h2><p>错误率的总体变化通常不足以定位问题。真正有用的是按错误类型和触发条件的分类统计。</p>\n<h3 id=\"错误分类维度\">错误分类维度</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>取值示例</th>\n<th>诊断价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>阶段</td>\n<td>解析 / 召回 / 打分 / 聚合 / 序列化</td>\n<td>定位改动引入的位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型</td>\n<td>语法错误 / 类型错误 / 超时 / OOM / 网络</td>\n<td>区分代码缺陷与容量问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP 状态</td>\n<td>400 / 429 / 500 / 503</td>\n<td>区分客户端与系统问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否新增</td>\n<td>基准无、候选有</td>\n<td>变更直接引入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否消失</td>\n<td>基准有、候选无</td>\n<td>变更修复或掩盖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「是否新增/是否消失」这两个标记是关键。新增错误是回归的直接证据；消失的错误可能是修复，也可能是异常被吞掉变成了零结果——后者更危险，因为它把错误转化成了静默失败。</p>\n<h3 id=\"错误率与延迟的关系\">错误率与延迟的关系</h3><p>错误和超时经常同源。一个因超时而失败的请求既是错误也是延迟问题。处理方式是把超时错误在延迟侧（见 <a href=\"latency-distribution-compare\">延迟分布回归（p50/p95/p99）</a>）作为删失观测计入，在错误侧作为超时率计入，两个数字都保留但<strong>在报告里建立关联</strong>——「p99 涨了 40%，同时超时率从 0.2% 涨到 1.8%」是一个自洽的结论，而分开看两个数字会让人以为是两个问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 错误分类对比（基准 vs 候选）&#10;WITH b AS (&#10;  SELECT trace_id, error_stage, error_type, status_code, count(*) AS n&#10;  FROM replay_result WHERE replay_run_id = :run AND version = &#39;baseline&#39; AND status &gt;= 400&#10;  GROUP BY 1,2,3,4&#10;), c AS (&#10;  SELECT trace_id, error_stage, error_type, status_code, count(*) AS n&#10;  FROM replay_result WHERE replay_run_id = :run AND version = &#39;candidate&#39; AND status &gt;= 400&#10;  GROUP BY 1,2,3,4&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  COALESCE(b.error_stage, c.error_stage)   AS stage,&#10;  COALESCE(b.error_type,  c.error_type)    AS type,&#10;  COALESCE(b.status_code, c.status_code)   AS status,&#10;  COALESCE(b.n, 0) AS n_base,&#10;  COALESCE(c.n, 0) AS n_cand,&#10;  CASE WHEN b.error_stage IS NULL THEN &#39;new&#39; WHEN c.error_stage IS NULL THEN &#39;gone&#39; ELSE &#39;both&#39; END AS appear&#10;FROM b FULL OUTER JOIN c USING (trace_id, error_stage, error_type, status_code)&#10;WHERE COALESCE(b.n,0) &lt;&gt; COALESCE(c.n,0)&#10;ORDER BY GREATEST(COALESCE(b.n,0), COALESCE(c.n,0)) DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 错误分类对比（基准 vs 候选）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace_id, error_stage, error_type, status_code, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replay_result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replay_run_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :run </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'baseline'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 400</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace_id, error_stage, error_type, status_code, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replay_result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replay_run_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :run </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'candidate'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 400</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">error_stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">error_stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stage,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">error_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">error_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_base,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_cand,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">error_stage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'new'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">error_stage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'gone'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'both'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> appear</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FULL OUTER JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (trace_id, error_stage, error_type, status_code)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GREATEST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>appear = &#39;new&#39;</code> 的行是最优先的排查对象，可以直接用 <code>trace_id</code> 跳到具体请求复现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"零结果率-条件对比而非绝对水平\">零结果率：条件对比而非绝对水平</h2><p>零结果率的绝对水平因业务而异——长尾商品库的零结果率天然比 Spotify 这种大曲库高。因此回归判定必须做<strong>条件对比</strong>：给定候选与基准在同一批查询上的表现。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基准</th>\n<th>候选</th>\n<th>判定</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有结果</td>\n<td>有结果</td>\n<td>一致</td>\n<td>忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有结果</td>\n<td>零结果</td>\n<td><strong>回归</strong>（丢召回）</td>\n<td>高优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零结果</td>\n<td>有结果</td>\n<td>改善（增益召回）</td>\n<td>记录，验证是否为垃圾结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零结果</td>\n<td>零结果</td>\n<td>一致</td>\n<td>忽略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个 2×2 表是零结果回归的全部逻辑骨架。「零结果 → 有结果」这一格容易被忽略，但它同样需要审查：新召回的内容如果是不相关的垃圾文档，用户在体验上并没有变好，反而可能更差。</p>\n<h3 id=\"零结果的成因分层\">零结果的成因分层</h3><p>知道零结果率涨了还不够，需要知道涨在哪一层。零结果的成因可以按链路分层归因，与 <a href=\"../result-set-diff/doc-set-add-remove-diff\">结果新增/消失逐条比对</a> 里的候选链路埋点复用同一份数据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成因层</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>修法方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分析器</td>\n<td>分词后的 term 集合与基准不同</td>\n<td>词表 / 分析器配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询理解</td>\n<td>改写后产生了矛盾的过滤条件</td>\n<td>改写规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>召回</td>\n<td>倒排/向量召回返回空</td>\n<td>索引结构 / 相似度阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过滤</td>\n<td>召回有、过滤后空</td>\n<td>过滤规则 / 字段值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折叠</td>\n<td>折叠后空（折叠键值异常）</td>\n<td>折叠配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限/可见性</td>\n<td>命中但全部不可见</td>\n<td>权限同步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分层归因的意义在于每一层的责任团队不同。把零结果率上升直接抛给「搜索相关性」团队，而实际原因在权限同步，会浪费数天排查。</p>\n<h3 id=\"零结果率的分母与权重\">零结果率的分母与权重</h3><p>零结果率的定义看起来平凡，但分母的选择影响结论。三种常见定义：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>ZRR</mtext><mtext>all</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>ZRR</mtext><mtext>filter</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>pre</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>post</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>ZRR</mtext><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>q</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>q</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ZRR}_{\\text{all}} = \\frac{\\#\\{h = 0\\}}{N}, \\qquad \\text{ZRR}_{\\text{filter}} = \\frac{\\#\\{h_{\\text{pre}} &gt; 0, h_{\\text{post}} = 0\\}}{N}, \\qquad \\text{ZRR}_w = \\frac{\\sum_{q} w_q \\mathbb{1}[h_q = 0]}{\\sum_q w_q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mo