le=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ZRR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6976em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5758em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8258em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第一个是朴素零结果率（含本来就该零结果的查询）；第二个只统计「过滤前有、过滤后无」的情况，最贴近「变更引入的问题」；第三个是流量加权版本。三者都要报，但门禁判定通常用第二个或第三个，因为第一个会被「本来就无解的长尾查询」主导。</p>\n<h2 id=\"静默降级-最需要警惕的形态\">静默降级：最需要警惕的形态</h2><p>有一类回归既不是错误也不是零结果，而是<strong>降级后仍然返回结果</strong>。典型的触发方式：新版本的某个环节超时，代码走上兜底路径——跳过排序优化、只用倒排不用向量、返回降级结果集。用户拿到了结果，错误率没涨，但结果质量已经不同了。</p>\n<p>检测这类问题需要显式记录降级标记：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsonc\" data-code=\"// 每条回放结果的执行路径标记&#10;{&#10;  &quot;trace_id&quot;: &quot;4bf92f35…&quot;,&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: 200,&#10;  &quot;path&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;ranking&quot;: &quot;full&quot;, // full | partial | fallback&#10;    &quot;retrieval&quot;: &quot;hybrid&quot;, // hybrid | lexical_only | vector_only&#10;    &quot;degraded&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;degrade_reason&quot;: &quot;vector_timeout&quot;,&#10;    &quot;degrade_ms&quot;: 250,&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;total_hits&quot;: 843,&#10;  &quot;latency_ms&quot;: 412,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 每条回放结果的执行路径标记</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"trace_id\": \"4bf92f35…\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"status\": 200,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"path\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"ranking\": \"full\", // full | partial | fallback</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"retrieval\": \"hybrid\", // hybrid | lexical_only | vector_only</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"degraded\": true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"degrade_reason\": \"vector_timeout\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"degrade_ms\": 250,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"total_hits\": 843,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"latency_ms\": 412,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>回归判定的规则是：<strong>候选的 <code>degraded=true</code> 比例不能高于基准</strong>。这比看错误率敏感得多，因为降级往往先于错误出现。同时 <code>degrade_reason</code> 的分布变化本身就是一个信号——如果超时降级从 0.1% 涨到 2%，说明新版本的某个依赖变慢了，即使整体延迟还没崩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三个指标的统一报告形态\">三个指标的统一报告形态</h2><p>错误率、零结果率、静默降级率应当放在同一张表里按查询切片呈现，而不是三个独立报表。它们的共同点是需要同一批切片才能互相印证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;  feature_bucket,&#10;  count(*)                                                        AS n,&#10;  avg((status &gt;= 400)::int)                                       AS err_rate,&#10;  avg((status &lt; 400 AND total_hits = 0)::int)                     AS zero_rate,&#10;  avg((status &lt; 400 AND degraded)::int)                           AS degrade_rate,&#10;  avg((status &lt; 400 AND total_hits &gt; 0 AND NOT degraded)::int)    AS healthy_rate&#10;FROM replay_result JOIN query_feature USING (trace_id)&#10;WHERE replay_run_id = :run AND version = &#39;candidate&#39;&#10;GROUP BY 1 HAVING count(*) &gt;= 200&#10;ORDER BY degrade_rate DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  feature_bucket,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 400</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_hits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> zero_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 400</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> degraded)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> degrade_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 400</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_hits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> degraded)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> healthy_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replay_result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query_feature </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (trace_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replay_run_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :run </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'candidate'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> degrade_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>healthy_rate</code>（成功且非零且未降级）是四个指标里最直观的一个：它是「用户真正得到正常服务」的比例。把它作为门禁的复合判据比任何单一指标都稳健——它不会因为某类失败被掩盖到另一类里而失真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>「没结果」分错误、零结果、全过滤三层，必须分别统计，混在一起会失去方向。</li>\n<li>错误率要按阶段与类型分类，并标记「新增错误」与「消失错误」；消失的错误可能只是变成了静默失败，更需要警惕。</li>\n<li>零结果率必须做条件对比（有→无 才算回归），并按分析器/改写/召回/过滤/折叠/权限分层归因。</li>\n<li>静默降级是错误率与零结果率都抓不到的形态，需要显式记录执行路径与降级原因并纳入门禁。</li>\n<li>用 <code>healthy_rate</code> 作为复合健康指标，可以避免单指标的掩盖效应。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>指标的稳定性依赖一套受控的查询集合，而不是每次都换一批流量——<a href=\"golden-query-set-baseline\">黄金查询集与基线管理</a> 讲的正是如何建立这套不漂移的坐标系。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"错误率/零结果率回归","id":"错误率-零结果率回归"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三个层级的「没结果」","id":"核心概念-三个层级的-没结果"},{"level":2,"text":"错误率回归：分类比总量更有用","id":"错误率回归-分类比总量更有用"},{"level":3,"text":"错误分类维度","id":"错误分类维度"},{"level":3,"text":"错误率与延迟的关系","id":"错误率与延迟的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"零结果率：条件对比而非绝对水平","id":"零结果率-条件对比而非绝对水平"},{"level":3,"text":"零结果的成因分层","id":"零结果的成因分层"},{"level":3,"text":"零结果率的分母与权重","id":"零结果率的分母与权重"},{"level":2,"text":"静默降级：最需要警惕的形态","id":"静默降级-最需要警惕的形态"},{"level":2,"text":"三个指标的统一报告形态","id":"三个指标的统一报告形态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"延迟分布回归（p50/p95/p99）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-query-replay-diff/perf-correctness-regression/latency-distribution-compare"},"next":{"title":"黄金查询集与基线管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-query-replay-diff/perf-correctness-regression/golden-query-set-baseline"}}